1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,999
[Music] My name is Geetha, I come from Kayamkulam. This is my mother.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:21,999
My mother is now 79 years old. Meanwhile, she had an attack. That is, one morning when my mother came to me,

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,999
I was standing having tea when she came and said, “Children, I had some pain in my chest and stomach last night.”

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:35,999
She said, “I was praying to Mother Mary.” The last November was the first time I came here and took the covenant.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:41,999
I had already given a testimony before that. I had a cancer of about seven centimeter in my throat,

6
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,999
and that was removed by my mother’s grace. That healing was my first testimony.

7
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:55,999
This is my second testimony — the healing of my mother. That morning my mother came crying and said,

8
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,999
“Children, I have pain. Yesterday, I didn’t call anyone; I was just praying to Mother Mary, holding my chest tightly.”

9
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:07,999
That day, my mother ate some dried jackfruit chips. Then I said, “Mom, that might cause gas.”

10
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,999
I told her not to eat all that, but she ate it anyway. She liked it and ate it. Now, this morning

11
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,999
I said, "Mom, maybe the jackfruit caused your stomach and chest pain." But after some time,

12
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:24,999
her left hand started swelling. Mom said, "Children, let me lie down for a while." I said, "Go and lie down."

13
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,999
Meanwhile, our respected Joseph Father’s online covenant meditation was going on.

14
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:36,999
I was listening to that, and I kept the phone on in the kitchen. I always like to listen to it; it’s very comforting to me.

15
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:40,999
While I was listening, my mother came close and said, "I’m going to lie down here." I told her, "Lie down and listen to this meditation."

16
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:46,999
While the meditation was playing, I checked and my mother was not visible. When I looked carefully,

17
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:52,999
she was lying down exhausted. I said, "Mom, I’m really worried. Children, I have a terrible pain in my chest. It must be because of the gas."

18
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:58,999
I said, "Shall we go to a nearby hospital?" She said, "No, I just want a little bit of water with some holy salt dissolved."

19
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:03,999
So I dissolved some holy salt in water and gave it to her, then recited the prayer of creed.

20
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:09,999
After that, I read the Bible and prayed a lot that my mother would be healed.

21
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:16,999
I had the Covenant medal with me, so I placed it on her chest and stomach and prayed because they were hurting.

22
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:22,999
That morning she said, "I have no problem, dear. Now I’m fine, I have no pain at all."

23
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:29,999
But after a while, the chest pain returned. So I gave her holy salt water again, applied the holy oil, made the sign of the cross,

24
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:34,999
and prayed, "Mother, may nothing bad happen to my mother."

25
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:39,999
My mother had come from your home to stay for 10 days, and if anything happened to her here

26
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:48,999
I didn’t know what to reply; I felt very troubled. Then during Father’s prayer, when he said to place hands on the sick area and pray for healing,

27
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:54,999
I ran to my mother, knelt down, and prayed. I placed my hands on her chest and stomach and prayed. Father was praying too.

28
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:03,999
He said, “We will receive healing. Our Mother will take all this away. Nothing will happen to our mother. She is with us.”

29
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:12,999
That faith was very strong in me. Not only the covenant intentions, but so many things have happened to me already.

30
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:20,999
My mother and Jesus have done so much for me. Just saying this is not enough — they have done so many things.

31
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:27,999
Like the healing of a tiny child, my mother has done many miracles for me.

32
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:34,999
Around noon, my mother said again she had chest pain and suddenly lay down calling out. I was reading the Bible at that time.

33
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:40,999
She came near and said, “Children, I have terrible chest pain.” When I went to her, she was sweating and had bathed.

34
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:49,999
I asked, “Mom, your blouse is all wet.” She said, “That’s water spilled from your son.”

35
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:57,999
That day she had a major attack. That night and the next evening, Mother Mary protected her without any problems.

36
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:06,999
I quickly took my son and myself to a nearby clinic. When we reached, they said it was a major attack, and she was in a critical stage.

37
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:11,999
They said she needed to be moved immediately to a hospital with ICU facilities.

38
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:16,999
My son and I were very worried. I had my covenant medal in my hand, which I placed on my mother’s chest and said,

39
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:31,999
“Mother, if you take care of my mother, I will have no problems and she will live. I have no one else. I’m speaking everything through my mother and I trust in Jesus and Mother Mary.”

40
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:42,999
I have immense faith that if you take care of her, she will live safely. So my son and I brought her to Kayamkulam Ebenezer Hospital.

41
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:53,999
The doctor examined her and said she was in a critical stage and might worsen. We must transfer her to Chengannur Hospital immediately, where there is cardiology.

42
00:04:54,000 --> 00:05:02,999
When we got into the ICU ambulance, her blood pressure and pulse dropped. Her legs were cold to touch, and her whole body was very cold.

43
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:10,999
She was lying there like a lifeless body. I held her tightly and kept my covenant medal on her chest without moving it and prayed,

44
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:17,999
“Mother, in this ambulance, may nothing happen to my mother. May she be with Jesus and Mother Mary you on this journey.”

45
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:23,999
My brother came with us, and until he arrived, I kept praying for my mother’s life.

46
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:30,999
Then my son and I took her to Chengannur hospital. When we arrived, they immediately admitted her to ICU.

47
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:36,999
They said she had three blockages and had already suffered two attacks; this was a major attack.

48
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:44,999
She had survived so long, but now surgery was necessary. They asked us to pay Rs. 2 lakh in advance. I only had 2000 rupees on me.

49
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:52,999
I was very worried. I had my covenant medal with me and prayed the prayer of creed. I said,

50
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:57,999
“Mother, I only have this 2000 rupees in my hand. I have no way to pay 2 lakh. Please save my mother.”

51
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:05,999
My mother knows that we will do everything possible to save her. The doctor wanted to refer us to Kottayam Medical College.

52
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:14,999
The doctor said if we took her from ICU, she would die. She was at a stage where surgery was possible.

53
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:21,999
I told the doctor we had no other option, but they refused to write the referral. My son cried that day.

54
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:26,999
When my uncle comes, I told her everything had happened but my mother was still fine.

55
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:31,999
Have faith son that nothing would happen to my mother and that she would be saved.

56
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:39,999
My son placed my mother to the ambulance carefully. We kept praying the prayer of creed as we traveled to Kottayam.

57
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:51,999
We prayed, placing my covenant medal on my mother’s chest. I don’t know how we reached Kottayam.

58
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:58,999
The doctor there said my mother was in critical condition due to a previous stroke and that nothing could be done.

59
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:08,999
We asked if anything could be done to keep her alive until my brother arrived. They said nothing could be done.

60
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:16,999
What saved her was my covenant medal and the anointing holy oil. I placed the covenant medal on her chest and prayed,

61
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:32,999
“Mother, stay with me. Do not let my mother suffer or have her chest cut open. If you want her, take her back to you, but only after my brother comes and sees her.”

62
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:39,999
After some time, when my brother comes, I don't know what to say to him so my mother please stay with me.

63
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:44,999
We prayed for a long time. Then after a while, my brother ran to us

64
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:49,999
I called out, "Mother!" Both of them started crying uncontrollably. Then I said,

65
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:55,999
"Jesus, now I have peace. You have been with me all this time for my sake, my mother. Now whatever happens, let it happen."

66
00:07:56,000 --> 00:08:01,999
When they took her inside for the operation, the doctor said she was too weak for surgery.

67
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:07,999
They suggested trying angioplasty to save her, but sometimes during angioplasty, a heart attack can happen and the person may die.

68
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:13,999
Otherwise, there is a chance of a stroke and bedridden condition. I was crying near the door,

69
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:21,999
clutching my covenant medal and rosary beads—my only support. I have no one else except Jesus and Mother Mary.

70
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:27,999
My Jesus and Mother Mary had to be in the operation theater holding the doctor's hands and equipment.

71
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:34,999
I prayed that my mother should be brought back healthy with no complications from surgery.

72
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:43,999
I prayed, "Jesus, just as Mother Mary is important to you, my mother is i tomportant me. I have no one else. Please bring her back to me."

73
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:49,999
I prayed to Jesus and cried bitterly. All my courage left me.

74
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:59,999
While I was crying in the hospital corridor, through a crowd, a shining figure came in. I don’t know who it was.

75
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:06,999
I was crouched down crying, and when I looked up, I saw a bright light. Someone gently touched my head and asked, "Why are you crying, child?"

76
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:17,999
I told him my mother was going for surgery inside, but the doctors said she might have a heart attack or a stroke, and her death was certain.

77
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:23,999
He said, "Nothing will happen to your mother. In five minutes, she will come back completely healed."

78
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:31,999
I opened my eyes slowly. I can’t see his face clearly, but that much light was shining in my eyes — it was Jesus.

79
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:37,999
When I looked back, the person was gone. After about five minutes, they brought my mother out without any problem.

80
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:44,999
I thanked Jesus and Mother Mary a thousand times.

81
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:53,999
Then on my mother’s leg appeared a mole about the size of a ghee lump, dark blue in color, and similarly another spot near her leg’s base.

82
00:09:54,000 --> 00:10:00,999
After a month, I brought my mother to see this and said, "Mom, what is this? I don’t understand." I was scared to show it to you so I waited.

83
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:10,999
I started crying again, saying, "Mother, what is this? I have gone through so many trials and nothing has changed. What’s next, Mother?"

84
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:20,999
I told my mother, "I will not take you to the hospital anymore. No more stories about hospitals. I will just apply holy oil, make the sign of the cross, and pray with the prayer of faith.

85
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:25,999
If this changes, even if the spots on your leg change, that’s enough. Otherwise, no changes needed."

86
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:29,999
I have faith in my mother and Jesus. I have no faith in medicines or rituals.

87
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:37,999
I will not take her anywhere else. I will keep applying the holy oil, making the sign of the cross, and praying the prayer of faith."

88
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:41,999
So for 15 days, I marked the cross with that holy oil on my mother’s leg.

89
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:47,999
When I finally looked, the spots kept changing, like the full moon hiding behind clouds,

90
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:53,999
completely healed by my Jesus and Mother Mary. We never had to go to any hospital again.

91
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:59,999
If we had gone to the hospital, they might have caused more problems, and it would have been unbearable for me.

92
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:09,999
Jesus gave me and my mother this healing. I can never thank Him enough. I have so many debts and obligations to Jesus and Mother Mary.

93
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:19,999
While my mother was lying in Kottayam hospital, she developed memory loss after the operation and lost her tubes and everything.

94
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:24,999
At that time, I thought, "Mother, I ran here with only one purse, no money in my hand."

95
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:30,999
Suddenly, I ran but had no cash, only my covenant medal in my hand. No papers or anything else.

96
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:34,999
My covenant medal was safe in my bag along with the holy salt and other things.

97
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:42,999
I didn’t even take out my bag fully, just the purse. I said, "Mother, who can I ask for help? There was no paper given to us when we were there."

98
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:50,999
I was very distressed and told my son, "Tomorrow, go home and bring holy salt, honey, and papers. We can give those to the patients here."

99
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:56,999
I said, "Our mother was saved because of Mother Mary and Jesus. We must thank them."

100
00:11:57,000 --> 00:12:02,999
After saying this, when I stepped outside to tell my son, I saw a newspaper lying on the floor.

101
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:09,999
I looked closely and realized it was the Kreupasanam newspaper. I always handle this paper.

102
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:14,999
Every month I buy this newspaper and deliver it by walking in sun or rain without fail.

103
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:23,999
I take pride in distributing this paper. Some people have mocked me asking if I also bring snacks like parippuvada or laddu.

104
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:29,999
I tell them, "I bring you these things now." Though mocked, I bear it all for Jesus.

105
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:42,999
I pray daily, anoint myself with holy oil, do evening prayers, read the Bible and Evangelization regularly.

106
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:52,999
Every month, I carry rice and give it to someone at the bus stand. I never eat without giving food to at least one person every day. This is my life.

107
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:56,999
This is how I have been doing things so far. Whenever someone shares their troubles,

108
00:12:57,000 --> 00:13:02,999
I try to help them as much as I can. While I was in Kottayam, a group came looking for food,

109
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:07,999
but they couldn’t get any. Two children and a woman had no solution. Then I said,

110
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:13,999
“Go have some coffee; there’s no money for food.” Then I showed them everything I had in my purse.

111
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:18,999
I gave it to them so they could buy food for the children. This is how I do apostolic work.

112
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:22,999
Later, I bought newspapers from here and distributed them at Kottayam Medical College.

113
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:29,999
At that time, I saw a man who lost a leg in an accident. His wife was struggling to take him to the bathroom.

114
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:35,999
I helped carry him to the bathroom, and they had some money for food in their hand and in mine as well.

115
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:39,999
Yes, that’s how I do apostolic and charitable works. Above all,

116
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:46,999
I am a person who does these things with the grace of my mother and Jesus.

117
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:50,999
I have received many, many blessings—both expected and unexpected.

118
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:59,999
I thank Jesus and my mother a thousand times. I will always be thankful. Praise Jesus, Amen.

119
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:07,999
Psalm 107:20-21 says: He sent his word and healed them, delivered them from their destructions.

120
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:15,999
Let them give thanks to the Lord for His mercy, and for His wonderful works to the children of men.

121
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:24,999
Sister Geetha, together with her mother, joyfully testifies here at this altar

122
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:32,999
about the great healing received through the use of the holy Kreupasanam Mother’s sacramental items.

123
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:39,999
Her mother suffered a heart attack, and when her condition became critical,

124
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:48,999
she was moved from one hospital to another — three hospitals in total. During this journey,

125
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:57,999
all the hospitals said her condition was very serious. Yet, with faith she kept the Kreupasanam Mother’s covenant medal on her body,

126
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:05,999
recited the prayer of faith, applied the holy oil, and took the blessed holy salt in water as prescribed.

127
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:12,999
The sister testifies how those hours and days passed, though death seemed certain.

128
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:19,999
Doctors hesitated even to admit her to ICU.

129
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:28,999
But throughout those moments, the sister’s intense prayer, unshakable faith,

130
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:35,999
and reliance on Kreupasanam Mother brought healing. She firmly believes that anyone who trusts

131
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:44,999
in Kreupasanam Mother through the saints will be blessed, healed, and strengthened to face life’s challenges.

132
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:50,999
This certainty is the testimony the sister shares, as she repeatedly prayed with tears on her mother’s forehead,

133
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:58,999
showing how that continuous prayer led to her mother’s recovery.

134
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:05,999
When taken inside the hospital ICU for angioplasty as an experimental procedure,

135
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:13,999
a radiant figure appeared to the sister, gently touched her head, assured her of healing,

136
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:20,999
and promised that her mother would return within five minutes. The sister testifies this. The covenant is a special part of life —

137
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:27,999
through words, people, and messages, we receive proper guidance. It is divine intervention that helps us,

138
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:34,999
and the sacramental items we use with hope help carry our life burdens and provide comfort.

139
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:41,999
This is the testimony the sister shares here at the altar. From death to life,

140
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:59,999
a 79-year-old mother was restored. The sister thanks the holy Kreupasanam Mother’s great protection,

141
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:07,999
which helped this family gain full health and complete healing. She offers thanks at the Mother’s holy feet.

142
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:15,999
Giving thanks to the Mother and Holy Trinity for these blessings received by this family, she folds her hands

143
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:22,999
and offers this testimony to us. May these extraordinary divine experiences be yours as well.

144
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:30,999
If you have not yet subscribed to this channel, please subscribe now. Share this video

145
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:35,000
with your friends and become a witness of the Lord.
